stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: source business transaction records allowlisted event
    pending --> delivered: matching Chronicle commit; source delivery acknowledgment
    delivered --> deleted: retention deadline; no hold or dependent proof; Chronicle present; not an operation replay barrier
    deleted --> [*]
    pending --> pending: delivery failure; retry or periodic scan
    delivered --> delivered: dependency or hold or issuance_purged replay barrier remains
    note right of delivered: bounded scan advances its cursor past retained rows; each later collection rechecks authority
